rs having checked all streets, and I have essentially a board-only hand with Queen kicker, betting would be a bluff. However, my opponent has shown no strength throughout. A value bet is incorrect here, but checking is free.\n\nReason:\nI have a very weak hand (two pair using only board cards with Queen kicker). My opponent has checked through every street, suggesting weakness, but they still likely have me beat with any card 6 or higher, or any Ace/Jack/Queen. Betting would be a pure bluff with poor equity. Since checking costs me nothing and gives me a chance to win if my opponent somehow has worse kickers (unlikely but possible), checking is the optimal play. Folding when I can check for free would be throwing away my only chance to win the pot.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
